<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1JN" style="id">1YOH ARUM</book>
  <para style="h">1 AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ayohana</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">AMGBASHO ATA JIJI ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">AYOHANA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">Amgbasho ata jiji ŋoh nza anyi na Ayohana reh a bu na ikpi.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Tsifa Ata Nza A bu Na Fene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 1:1" />Mbohroh meh leh bleh noh tsifa ata ta ka a jiji a yama ata mbohroh timi kǝ sehreh reh, mbohroh timi nza ŋoh na iyo ambohroh, mbohroh timi nza tasa za meh bara na ivoh ambohroh mboh, wohroh reh a bu ma ikpi tsifa ata nza a bu na fene reh. <verse eid="1JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 1:2" />Ma a tsana reh tsifa ata nza a bu na fene reh a kate; mbohroh meh nza na iyo ambohroh tasa za meh leh bleh ma ikpi a ŋoh, tasa za meh leh bleh noh la a bu ŋoh nza a bu na fene ata tuma atono reh, ata nza a bu na Ada tasa za ma a tsana ŋoh a kate na ambohroh. <verse eid="1JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 1:3" />Mbohroh meh leh bleh noh andromboh ata meh nza, tasa za ata meh sehreh reh, la mbohroh ma amohnoh meh ti dohsohna. Dohsohkpi ambohroh reh a bu na Ada tasa na amehreh a ŋoh Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="1JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 1:4" />Mbohroh meh ŋa ata areh ba nnoh la nana agohsoh ambohroh reh ta a su.<verse eid="1JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hende Nimeh Zanana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 1:5" />Ata areh a bu tohmoh ata mbohroh nza meh sehreh nyi na a ŋoh reh, mbohroh nza meh leh bleh noh la, Nnoh reh a bu zanana; na a ŋoh reh shini a mishi a yama mbimbi kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 1:6" />Nza mbohroh meh bleh la meh bu na dohsohkpi na Nnoh, mbohroh neh meh ti tre leh hende nimeh shini, mbohroh meh huru tsifa tasa za meh tufa aki a zizi reh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 1:7" />Nza mbohroh neh meh hende nimeh zanana, tswanza ŋoh nza bu nimeh zanana reh, mbohroh meh dohsohkpi ma itoh ambohroh, tasa imya Yeso amehreh a ŋoh za a nati a hwara reh anyi na kpakpana ambohroh mboh nambri.<verse eid="1JN 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 1:8" />Nza mbohroh meh bleh la meh bu na kpakpana kpeh, meh landa ikpi ambohroh tasa za a zizi a bu na ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 1:9" />Nza mbohroh meh bleh kpakpana ambohroh ma Nnoh kate reh, ŋoh a bu na agohsoh alindeh tasa za ka a bleh zizi, ŋoh a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh mboh reh tasa za a nati a hwara reh anyi ma aki tufa ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh reh. <verse eid="1JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 1:10" />Nza mbohroh meh bleh la meh bu na kpakpana kpeh reh, mbohroh meh gu la Nnoh reh a huru tsifa, tasa za tsifa a ŋoh a yama nimeh agohsoh ambohroh kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1JN 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 2:1" />mohnoh mara amya mboh ata mya nza ni kira na amohnoh reh, meh ŋa amgbasho ata reh ba nnoh la ti kama kpakpana nnoh kpeh. Nza akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh neh a kpakpana, meh bu na akyo ata nza a nati a shingi reh a na na Ada ambohroh ta a shi reh, ŋoh wohroh reh a bu Yeso Kristi ata nza a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1JN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 2:2" />Yeso Kristi a gu ikpi a ŋoh a fanga a sangra imiya na kira a ŋoh, tsifa kpakpana ambohroh mboh, tasa za a bu tsifa kpakpana ambohroh Mbohroh tsimbohro kpeh, tasa za neh a bu tsifa kpakpana inziyo areh na agba ma.<verse eid="1JN 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 2:3" />Nza mbohroh meh tufa akpi Nnoh reh, a nati a tsana la mbohroh reh meh wina ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 2:4" />Akyo ata nza a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh wina ŋoh,&gt;&gt; ŋoh neh a sohroh a tufa tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh kpeh, a huru tsifa, a zizi a bu na a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 2:5" />Akyo ata neh nza a tufa tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh yehlehleh, a bu zizi la kira Nnoh reh a bu na a ŋoh na su ma. A bu ata areh a nati a tsana la zizi meh bu na a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 2:6" />Akyo ata nza a bleh la ŋoh wa a tuma nimeh Nnoh, a nati a hehndeh tswanza Yeso kristi reh.<verse eid="1JN 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akpi Afeh ŊOH</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 2:7" />ambohroh mboh, a bu akpi afeh meh leh ŋa ba nnoh kpeh, akpi reh neh a bu atono akpi, ata ni bu noh na wohroh nyi jiji reh. Akpi atono reh a bu tohmoh ata ni sere na kpikpi reh. <verse eid="1JN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 2:8" />Dehreh za, meh gyuru ŋa tsifa afeh anyi ba nnoh za, ata nza a bu na kira Kristi, a bu dehreh za na amohnoh, tsifa la shini a buti a gǝga zana ata a zizi a buti zana atsifi.<verse eid="1JN 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 2:9" />Akyo ata nza a bleh la ŋoh a bu nimeh zanana, ŋoh neh ata a kira ta a nza atsini ha asra a ŋoh ma iyo kpeh reh, a treh a bu nimeh shini. <verse eid="1JN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 2:10" />Akyo ata neh nza a kira na atsini mboh ha asra a ŋoh mboh, ŋoh reh a buti tuma nimeh zanana, akyo a nati a kpa hwana a hwa tsifa a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 2:11" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta a nza atsini ha asra ŋoh ma iyo kpeh reh a bu nimeh shini, tasa za a bu ti leh hende nimeh shini, a sohroh a wina aki na a ŋoh kpeh, shini reh kǝ hama ŋoh iyo.<verse eid="1JN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 2:12" />mohnoh mara amya mboh amboh ata mya nza ni kira reh, meh ŋa ba nnoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:12">tsifa la ma a te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh mboh nimeh isa Yeso.<verse eid="1JN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 2:13" />Meh ŋa ba nnoh, mohnoh ada mboh, la mohnoh ni wina noh ata nza anyi ma jiji reh. Meh ŋa ba nnoh mohnoh mara kafa mboh, la mohnoh ni keh nnoh wuwana agugu reh<verse eid="1JN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 2:14" />tsifa la ni wina noh ŋoh ata nza a yama anyi ma jiji reh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1JN 2:14">meh ŋa ba nnoh, mohnoh kafa mboh za,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">tsifa la ni bu noh na wuwana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">tsifa la Nnoh reh a bu nimeh amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1JN 2:14">ni nati keh nnoh wuwana agugu reh.<verse eid="1JN 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 2:15" />Kama kira nnoh na inziyo ha na awumu amboh ata nza ma a yama nimeh inziyo reh kpeh. Nza akyo ata nza a kira na awumu inziyo reh, kira ada reh a bu na a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 2:16" />Awumu mboh nza ma a bu ma inziyo reh nambri, tswanza mira iyo na awumu ata itoh nza a kira, tasa te iyo, tasa va ivoh ma agohsoh na awumu inziyo reh. Awumu amboh areh ma a sohroh anyi na Ada kpeh, ma anyi inziyo mi. <verse eid="1JN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 2:17" />Inziyo reh tasa awumu mira iyo mboh reh a nati a trina, akyo ata nza a tufa tsifa Nnoh reh neh a nati anvara ta a tuma atono.<verse eid="1JN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Ata Nza A fi Yeso Kristi Ma Tohmoh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 2:18" />mohnoh mara amya mboh, inziyo reh wa a nati a trina! tswanza tama ka a bleh noh reh la, kyangwri ata nza a fi Yeso ma tohmoh reh a nati a ba, nehnehreh amboh ata nza ma a fi Yeso ma tohmoh reh ma a yama, a bu wohroh Mbohroh nza meh wina la inziyo reh wa a nati a trina. <verse eid="1JN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 2:19" />amboh ata nza ma a fi Yeso ma tohmoh reh tama a bu nimeh ambohroh, nehnehreh neh ma za a bu na ambohroh za kpeh, na kpikpi reh ma tama a bu ambohroh kpeh, ma a bleh la ma a bu na ambohroh reh, nda ma a hehreh ata reh kpeh, nza nehnehreh ma a gbo ata reh. Ata areh a tsana la nambri ma amoh ma ambohroh kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 2:20" />Kristi neh nza a bu zanana reh, kǝ nga nnoh huru zanana a ŋoh reh, la nambri ma amohnoh ti wina noh andromboh ata nza bu zizi reh. <verse eid="1JN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 2:21" />Meh ŋa amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh, a bu tsifa la ni sohroh wina noh tsifa Nnoh ata a zizi reh kpeh, meh ŋa ba nnoh tsifa la ni wina noh tsifa Nnoh reh ata a zizi, ni wina noh za la a zizi reh ka a mara huru tsifa kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 2:22" />A bu anyi ata nza bu kyangwri huru tsifa reh? A bu amboh ata nza ma a bleh la Yeso a bu ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh kpeh. Kyangwri amboh wohroh reh ma bu mboh nza ma a fi Yeso ma tohmoh reh, ma a leke Ada tasa Amehreh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 2:23" />amboh ata nza ma a leke Amehreh Nnoh reh, ma a leke Ada za, amboh ata nza ma a sa Ada reh ma a sa Ada za.<verse eid="1JN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 2:24" />mohnoh nza noh la tsana ata nza ma a tsana noh anyi jiji reh a treh a bu nimeh amohnoh. Nza a bu dehreh reh, ni nati bu noh nimeh amehreh reh tasa nimeh Ada. <verse eid="1JN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1JN 2:25" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata amehreh reh nza a bleh a gya la ŋoh a nati a nga reh, a bu fene ata tuma atono.<verse eid="1JN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1JN 2:26" />Meh ŋa tsifa mboh reh ba nnoh, ma ikpi amboh ata nza ma a nati a kira la mata a landa nnoh, la ti ta nnoh aki Nnoh ata a zizi reh. <verse eid="1JN 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1JN 2:27" />mohnoh feh, huru Nnoh ata nza ni sa nyi nnoh na Kristi reh, a treh a bu na amohnoh, akyo a nati a za a tsana noh andromboh za kpeh. Huru a ŋoh reh a nati a leh a tsana noh awumu mboh reh nambri, tsana a ŋoh reh a nati a bu zizi, a nati a bu ata huru tsifa kpeh, nza a bu dehreh ti leh rya nnoh tohmoh na ndohmoh amohnoh nimeh Yeso tswanza huru nza a tsana noh reh.<verse eid="1JN 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mara Nnoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1JN 2:28" />Nehnehreh, mohnoh mara amya mboh amboh ata mya nza ni kira na amohnoh, tuma noh nimeh Kristi, la nza tana a nati a ba reh Mbohroh meh ti bu na nyiri ha kwo sa kpeh ma tohmoh a ŋoh.<verse eid="1JN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1JN 2:29" />Nza mohnoh ni wina noh la Kristi reh a bu yehlehleh, ni nati kira nnoh la akyo ata nza a lisa awumu yehlehleh reh a bu amehreh Nnoh.<verse eid="1JN 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1JN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mara Nnoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 3:1" />Nza nnoh biroh kira gaga ikata Ada nza a tsana reh reh! A tswa atsi keh mata a fi reh la mara Nnoh mboh, a bu dehreh zizi. Tsifa wohroh inziyo reh a wina reh kpeh, tasa za a wina Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 3:2" />Iziza amya mboh amboh ata mya nza ni kira na amoh, nehnehreh Mbohroh meh bu mara Nnoh mboh, nehnehreh neh ma a hehreh a bleh reh ha meh kǝ nati bu lele ma tohmoh kpeh. Mbohroh neh meh wina la ibi ata Kristi tana a nati a ba reh, meh nati tswanza ŋoh reh, tasa za meh nati nza ŋoh kakende. <verse eid="1JN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 3:3" />Akyo ata nza a gya agohsoh ma ikpi Kristi reh a nati a de ikpi a ŋoh fyafya tswanza Kristi za nza bu fyafya reh.<verse eid="1JN 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 3:4" />Akyo ata nza a kpakpana reh, a kputu akpi Nnoh, kpakpana reh a bu wohroh nza bu kputu akpi reh. <verse eid="1JN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 3:5" />mohnoh ni wina noh la Yeso reh a ba la ŋoh ta a gu kpakpana ambohroh reh, ŋoh feh a sohroh a bu na kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 3:6" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, akyo ata nza a tuma nimeh Kristi reh a nati a za a leh a kpakpana za kpeh, akyo ata nza a leh a kpakpana reh neh, kǝ hehreh nza Yeso reh kpeh, tasa za a sohroh a wina ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 3:7" />mohnoh mara amya mboh, akyo ta a kama a landa nnoh kpeh! Akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh a tufa yehlehleh, tswanza Kristi za nza a bu yehlehleh reh. <verse eid="1JN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 3:8" />Akyo ata nza a leh a kpakpana a nina ma reh, ŋoh a tswanza agugu reh, tsifa la ŋoh agugu reh tana a jiji a kpakpana anyi jiji ŋoh, a bu tsifa wohroh Amehreh Nnoh nza a ba inziyo areh la ŋoh ta a druhu ndohmoh agugu reh.<verse eid="1JN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 3:9" />amboh ata nza ma a bu mara Nnoh mboh reh, ma a nati a leh a kpakpana a nina kpeh, biroh alindeh Nnoh reh a bu na amoh, Nnoh nza a bu Ada amoh reh, ma a nati a za a kpakpana za kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 3:10" />amboh ata nza ma a bu mara Nnoh mboh reh ma bu tse na mara agugu mboh reh, akyo ata nza a lisa andromboh ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh reh, ŋoh a bu amehreh Nnoh kpeh, tasa za akyo ata nza a kira na atsini kpeh ŋoh za a bu amehreh Nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kira Na Atohngoh Anzoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 3:11" />Ata areh a bu tsifa ata Mbohroh nza meh sere nyi jiji reh la, meh kira na itoh ambohroh. <verse eid="1JN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 3:12" />Kama bu noh tswanza Kayinu ata nza bu Agugu a ŋoh tasa za tana a mla atsini a kwo. Tana ka a mla atsini feh a kwo tsifa umbo? Tana a mla a kwo tsifa la kohnoh a ŋoh a bu ata agugu, kohnoh atsini neh tana a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="1JN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 3:13" />Kama shi ŋara nnoh aniye ma kpeh, atsi amya mboh, nza inziyo ma a leke nnoh reh. <verse eid="1JN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 3:14" />Mbohroh meh wina la ma a sehneh reh anyi ma kwo ata huru a ba na fene ata huru, tsifa meh kira na itoh ambohroh. Akyo ata nza a kira na atohngoh kpeh reh a treh a bu nimeh kwo ata huru. <verse eid="1JN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 3:15" />Akyo ata nza a leke imya atsini, ŋoh a bu kyangwri mla kyangwri kwo. Tasa za ni wina noh la kyangwri ata ka mla kyangwri kwo reh a bu na fene ata tuma nimeh a ŋoh kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 3:16" />Nza atsi ata meh nati nza kira wina reh, Yeso a gu fene a ŋoh a fanga tsifa ambohroh. Mbohroh za a zohhoh meh ti gu fene ambohroh nga atsi ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="1JN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 3:17" />Nza akyo amohnoh anyi a bu na asabara, tasa atohngoh anyi a bu na andromboh kpeh, ŋoh neh a sohroh a nza kwini a ŋoh kpeh, kira Nnoh reh ka a bu nimeh a ŋoh zizi? <verse eid="1JN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 3:18" />mohnoh mara amya mboh, amboh ata mya nza ni kira, kama tsana noh kira amohnoh ma atsi tsifa aniye wusu ma kpeh, kira amohnoh reh ta bu ata te ndohmoh tasa ata a zizi.<verse eid="1JN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shi Wuwana Ma tomo Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 3:19" />Ma aki wohroh meh nati wina la meh bu zizi, tasa za ika ata agohsoh ambohroh a nati a tsana la meh tswa meh ti shi ma tohmoh Nnoh, <verse eid="1JN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 3:20" />ameh ata agohsoh ambohroh a keshe reh . Nnoh reh a keh agohsoh ambohroh reh, tasa za a wina awumu mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="1JN 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 3:21" />mohnoh mara amya mboh, amboh ata mya nza ni kira, nza agohsoh ambohroh a tsana reh la meh bu na kpakpana kpeh, meh bu na wuwa agohsoh ata meh nati wina shi ma tohmoh Nnoh, <verse eid="1JN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1JN 3:22" />meh ti hunji awumu ata nza meh kwere na a ŋoh reh, tsifa la meh kira na tsifa a ŋoh reh tasa za meh lisa andromboh ata nza a nana ŋoh agohsoh. <verse eid="1JN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1JN 3:23" />Ata areh a bu andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh la meh ti lisa reh: la Mbohroh meh ti nga agohsoh na sa amehreh a ŋoh Yeso Kristi, meh ti kira na itoh ambohroh tswanza ŋoh nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="1JN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1JN 3:24" />amboh ata nza ma a tufa tsifa a ŋoh reh ma a tuma nimeh a ŋoh, tasa ŋoh za a tuma nimeh amoh. Nza atsi ata meh nati wina la a bu nimeh ambohroh reh: Meh wina nyi na huru ata ŋoh nza a nga reh reh.<verse eid="1JN 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1JN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Tsara Huru Mboh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 4:1" />mohnoh atsi mya mboh amboh ata mya nza ni kira na amoh, kama nga noh kira na huru mboh reh nambri kpeh, mohnoh neh tsara nnoh huru mboh reh nza noh ha ma anyi na Nnoh, tsifa la amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa maka a yangana a treh inziyo reh. <verse eid="1JN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 4:2" />Ni nati wina lele la akyo a bu na Huru Nnoh na a ŋoh? Akyo ata nza a kira, la Yeso Kristi a ba nimeh itoh kyangwri, bu ŋoh mi a bu na huru Nnoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 4:3" />Huru mboh nambri neh ata nza ma a kira na Yeso kpeh a bu ata Nnoh kpeh. Areh a bu huru ata nza a kira na Huru Nnoh kpeh, ata nza sere nnoh la a nati ba reh tasa nehnehreh kǝ ba ma inziyo. <verse eid="1JN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 4:4" />mohnoh mara kira mya amboh, mohnoh ni bu noh ata Nnoh, ni keh nnoh wuwana amboh sa tohmoh nyi na Nnoh ata huru tsifa mboh reh, tsifa la huru Nnoh ata nza a bu na amohnoh a bu agba a keh ata nza a bu nimeh inziyo. <verse eid="1JN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 4:5" />Mboh ma a bu ata inziyo, bu tsifa wohroh reh nza ma atsifa biroh amboh inziyo mboh, tasa inziyo maka a shi a sehreh mboh. <verse eid="1JN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 4:6" />mbohroh neh meh nyi na Nnoh, tasa akyo wohroh ata nza a wina Nnoh a ka a sehreh tsifa ambohroh; akyo neh nza anyi na Nnoh kpeh a ka a sehreh tsifa ambohroh kpeh. Nza nnoh nza meh kǝ nza Huru ata a zizi wina reh tasa huru ata huru tsifa.<verse eid="1JN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnoh Bu Kira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 4:7" />Iziza mya mboh ata mya nza meh kira na amoh, ba nnoh meh ti kira ni itoh mbohroh, kira anyi na Nnoh. Akyo ata nza ka kira ŋoh bu amehreh Nnoh mi tasa a wina Nnoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 4:8" />Akyo ata nza ka a kira kpeh a wina Nnoh kpeh, tsifa la Nnoh a bu kira. <verse eid="1JN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 4:9" />Nza nnoh tswanza Nnoh nza ka a tsana kira a ŋoh. A tohmoh amehreh a ŋoh a ba inziyo la meh ti hunji fene nyi na a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 4:10" />Areh bu kira ata a zizi: bu la bu Mbohroh meh kira Nnoh kpeh, a bu ŋoh mi a kira na ambohroh nza a tohmoh amehreh a ŋoh nza a ba ba a kohrohna a sangra imya ma ikpi kpakpana mboh ambohroh <verse eid="1JN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 4:11" />Iziza amya mboh amboh ata meh nza kira na amoh, Nnoh a kira na ambohroh dehreh, a zohhoh mbohroh meh ti kira na itoh ambohroh za. <verse eid="1JN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 4:12" />Akyo kǝ hehreh nza Nnoh kpeh; nza meh kira na itoh ambohroh neh, Nnoh a bu nimeh ambohroh tasa kira a ŋoh reh ka bu na su nimeh ambohroh. <verse eid="1JN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 4:13" />Meh wina la meh tuma nimeh a ŋoh tasa ŋoh nimeh ambohroh, tsifa la ŋoh kǝ nga reh ata Huru a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 4:14" />Tasa timi nza bleh na aniye ambohroh la Ada reh kǝ tohmoh Amehreh a ŋoh ta a bu ata sa inziyo anvara. <verse eid="1JN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 4:15" />Akyo ata nza a vuru aniye a ŋoh a kira la Yeso bu Amehreh Nnoh, Nnoh a bu nimeh a ŋoh tasa ŋoh nimeh Nnoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 4:16" />Mbohroh ni ikpi ambohroh meh nga agohsoh ni kira ata Nnoh nza a gya reh. Nnoh a bu kira. Akyo ata nza a tuma nimeh a kira a tuma nimeh Nnoh, tasa Nnoh nimeh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 4:17" />Ma aki wohroh kira ka a bu na su nimeh ambohroh tsifa la agohsoh ambohroh bu anyimbehreh meh nati shi ma tohmoh Nnoh ibi ata nza a nati hwra akpi tswanza Yeso nza a bu Mbohroh za meh bu dehreh ma inziyo areh <verse eid="1JN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 4:18" />Ma atsi kira nza a yama, nyiri a ka a yama kpeh, tsifa la, kira ata alindeh a ka a katsi nyiri. nza kyangwri a bu na nyiri, la nyiri reh a bu hwra akpi. akyo ata nza a bu na nyiri a bu na kira alindeh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 4:19" />Meh kira itoh ambohroh tsifa la Bu Nnoh a jiji a kira na ambohroh. <verse eid="1JN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 4:20" />Akyo ata nza a bleh la, &lt;Meh kira Nnoh,&gt; neh a leke imya atsini, kyangwri reh a huru tsifa. tsifa la, akyo ata nza a kira atsini kpeh, ata nza ka a nza na iyo, a nati wina kira Nnoh kpeh ata nza ka a nza na iyo kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 4:21" />Tasa ta ka a bleh reh la, akyo ata nza a kira Nnoh kanga a kira atsini.<verse eid="1JN 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1JN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Rya tomwo Ma Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1JN 5:1" />Akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh la Yeso a bu Kristi a bu amehreh Nnoh, tasa akyo ata nza a kira Ada reh a kira amehreh ŋoh za. <verse eid="1JN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1JN 5:2" />Meh nati lisa lele la meh wina mara Nnoh mboh meh nati wina nza meh kira Nnoh tasa meh kǝ tufa aki a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1JN 5:3" />Areh bu kira Nnoh: meh ti tufa tsifa a ŋoh mboh Tasa tufa tsifa a ŋoh mboh ta a kama a bu iya na ambohroh kpeh, <verse eid="1JN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1JN 5:4" />akyo ata nza a bu amehreh Nnoh a ka a keh wuwana inziyo reh. Areh bu rya tohmoh ata nza kǝ keh wuwana inziyo, gya agohsoh ambohroh za. <verse eid="1JN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1JN 5:5" />A bu anyi a nati rya tohmoh na inziyo? Bu akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh la Yeso bu Amehreh Nnoh.<verse eid="1JN 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bleh Tsifa Ma Ikpi Yeso Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1JN 5:6" />Areh a bu ŋoh ta ka a ba Ma a tsana Yeso Kristi a bu Amehreh Nnoh atsi wra ŋoh batisma ma amwo tasa ma aki sangra imya a ŋoh ma gbohrohgboh, bu amwo tsene kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1JN 5:7" />Awumu mboh atatoh ma a yama amboh nza ma a nati tsana la: <verse eid="1JN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1JN 5:8" />Huru, amwo, tasa imya reh; mboh na atatoh ma amoh aniye amoh bu anyimbehreh. <verse eid="1JN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1JN 5:9" />Meh kira na kyangwri mboh amboh ata nza ma a bleh tsifa ma ikpi andromboh ata mboh nza ma wina reh. Dehreh za meh nati keh nga agohsoh ma ikpi andromboh ata Nnoh neh nza a bleh ma ikpi Amehreh a ŋoh reh a keh agba. <verse eid="1JN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1JN 5:10" />Akyo ata nza a nga agohsoh a ŋoh ma Amehreh Nnoh a bu na bleh tsifa ata areh ma agohsoh a ŋoh. Akyo ata nza a kira na Nnoh kpeh, a gyuru Nnoh a te la a huru tsifa, a nga agohsoh nimeh bleh tsifa Nnoh nza a bleh ma ikpi Amehreh a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1JN 5:11" />Areh bu andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh reh la Nnoh a nga reh fene ata tuma atono, tasa fene reh a bu nimeh Amehreh a ŋoh. <verse eid="1JN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1JN 5:12" />Akyo ata nza a hunji Amehreh reh; akyo ata nza a hunji Amehreh Nnoh kpeh a sohroh a bu na fene kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fene ata tuma atono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1JN 5:13" />Meh ŋa awumu amboh ata areh ba nnoh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni nga nnoh kira nimeh sa Amehreh Nnoh la handuhwa ti wina la ni bu noh na fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="1JN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1JN 5:14" />Areh bu wuwa agohsoh reh ata nza meh bu na wohroh nza meh kpusu ba nda na Nnoh: La nza meh luhu ŋoh andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira la meh ti hunji, a ka a sehreh reh. <verse eid="1JN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1JN 5:15" />Nza mbohroh meh wina la a ka a sehreh reh andromboh ata nza meh luhu ŋoh reh, meh wina la meh nati hunji andromboh ata nza meh luhu ŋoh.<verse eid="1JN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1JN 5:16" />Nza akyo anyi a nza atsini atsi kpakpana ata nza a nati a gu ŋoh a fi nimeh kwo kpeh, kwere la Nnoh a nga ŋoh fene. Meh tsifa ma ikpi amboh ata kpakpana amoh a nati a gu mboh a na na niye nimeh kwo kpeh. Kpakpana anyi a yama ata ka a gu akyo aniye nimeh kwo. Meh bleh la ti kwere Nnoh ma amboh wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1JN 5:17" />Lisa abibi nambri, a bu kpakpana, tasa kpakpana anyi a yama ata nza ka a gu na niye kwo kpeh.<verse eid="1JN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1JN 5:18" />Meh wina la akyo ata Nnoh nza a mara ŋoh maka a rya tohmoh na kpakpana kpeh; ata Nnoh ta ka a mara ka a gya ŋoh alindeh, tasa amboh ata agugu reh ma a nati wina te ŋoh andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="1JN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1JN 5:19" />Meh wina la meh bu mara Nnoh mboh, tasa la inziyo agba reh nambri a bu ma ivoh agugu reh. <verse eid="1JN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1JN 5:20" />Meh wina za la Amehreh Nnoh reh kǝ ba tasa kǝ nga reh sere wina dehreh la handuhwa meh ti wina ŋoh ata nza a bu zizi. Tasa meh bu nimeh a ŋoh ata nza a bu zizi, nimeh Amehreh ŋoh za Yeso Kristi. Ŋoh a bu a zizi Nnoh reh tasa tuma atono. <verse eid="1JN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1JN 5:21" />Mara ata mya nza ni kira mboh, kpi nnoh ikpi amohnoh kate nyi nnoh ma aki tufa nnoh akǝkehreh mboh reh.<verse eid="1JN 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1JN 5" />
</usx>